WEBVTT

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.780
Angelique!

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:26.370
I'll hit Angelique!

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:33.970
Angie!

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:35.620
Jade!

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.490
Angie!

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:05.930
Jade!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:07.790
Angie!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.320
Angie!

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:57.080
Phase 12: The Captured Angelique

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:10.360
Why have you kidnapped me?

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:14.350
Why did you have to hurt everyone?

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:18.340
You and Jade are like brothers, right?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:19.730
Brothers?

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:20.980
Yes.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.520
You're both Artifacts.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.650
The original is defective.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:29.370
Sooner or later, it will malfunction.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.940
No, Jade is...

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:40.290
We will arrive at the city in seven minutes and thirty seconds.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:41.900
Keep quiet.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:54.330
What are you doing?

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.550
You're hurt too.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:06.060
Your actions are strange.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.290
Pharian?

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.570
You're sure?

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:20.890
Angelique is in Pharian, right?

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:29.120
I looked into other facilities and reams of documentation, but Foundation HQ is the only place with automobiles of that type.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.130
Foundation HQ?

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:33.730
It can't be Yorgo...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:39.280
No, he's been at the Diet for the last few days concerning the problems with the Jinx.

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:43.050
It's probably an unrelated act carried out by an individual.

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:44.990
Is that so?

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:49.930
Then, leave the rest to us.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:52.570
I'm sorry, Lein.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.560
This is all I can do now.

00:04:56.780 --> 00:04:58.780
Take care of Angelique.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.140
This is...

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.210
Angelique's...

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.450
I've finally understood.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:25.100
I have to tell you something important.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:30.580
Be safe, little Angie.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:46.850
With Yorgo gone, there's only one other person who can use the Jasper Dolls or give orders.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.250
Elenfriet.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.510
Why would that kid want Angelique so badly?

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.160
The Jinx's continuing defeats have made him panic.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:06:00.100
He's probably trying to use Angelique's power to strengthen the Jinx...

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:02.540
without worrying about the substantial risk involved.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:05.320
My, my, what a troublesome child.

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.010
He probably knows we're coming and has set an ambush.

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.900
He's risking everything for this.

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.980
He'll probably throw everything he's got at us.

00:06:14.050 --> 00:06:17.510
But if we leave now, we'll arrive at Pharian at nightfall.

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:24.350
So we'll have the perfect stage for saving the princess from the villain, huh?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.310
What's wrong, Jade?

00:06:27.930 --> 00:06:33.940
I was reminiscing about the time I spent with Angie at the Sunlit Mansion.

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:39.000
All I can do now is remember those warm times.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.170
That saddens me greatly.

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:46.640
Angie's there. We're there. The Sunlit Mansion is there.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.780
At some point, that became natural.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.370
We'll recover it.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.060
The warm light that shines over us...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.080
Even if it costs me my life.

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:04.340
Even so, if even one of us dies, those days will never return.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.220
We'll come back.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.030
All of us plus Angelique too; we'll return to the Sunlit Mansion!

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.120
To our home!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.320
Where am I?

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:30.100
Welcome to the Artifact Foundation.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:36.200
I apologize for the rough treatment.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:39.730
I assumed that anything less would mean I couldn't invite you here.{say what?}

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.250
Let me go!

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.400
Please, let me go!

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.270
You don't like it?

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:49.820
It's a special chair developed for the Queen's Egg to use.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:57.570
It is also the greatest of instruments; one which will finally complete my research.

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:02.340
The Queen's Egg: the perfect Purifier.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:07.820
If I can transfer your power to the Jinx, they'll be able to purify all the Thanatos.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.460
You'll help me, won't you?

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:15.570
I disagree with your methods.

00:08:15.710 --> 00:08:21.170
You destroy houses, towns, and even people to defeat Thanatos.

00:08:24.040 --> 00:08:29.450
As long as you keep using the Jinx that way, I refuse to help you.

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.600
That's you answer, is it?

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.280
Then...

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:36.730
Then what else do you suggest?

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:41.190
All I've done is take the best course of action I could.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:45.850
But at the moment, the Jinx are making people suffer...

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:48.060
My Jinx are perfect.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:51.780
I just haven't been able to modify them to match the change in the Thanatos.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:55.520
Once I do, even Director Yorgo...

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.130
That's why I need your power.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:01.770
The sacrifice of a single person can save the world!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.090
Sacrifice?

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.270
That's right.

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:16.240
A noble sacrifice is required in the name of science.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:21.740
It's for the sake of the world, so I'm sure you're ecstatic as the Queen's Egg, right?

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:25.730
What you're suggesting isn't for the sake of the world.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.240
It's for your own sake.

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.200
What?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:32.320
Lein told me that you've become the same as he used to be.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:35.450
You're so obsessed with your research that you've become blinkered.

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:40.450
But one day, Lein realized that was the wrong way to do things.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.980
He wants you to realize this too...

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:44.090
That's enough!

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:45.150
Shut up!

00:09:45.340 --> 00:09:46.800
I'm starting the experiment.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:50.960
Jet, place the device on the research subject.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:52.730
Understood.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:54.980
Placing the device on the research subject.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:09:59.460
Stop this!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:00.670
Jet...

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.040
Keep still.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.040
Goodnight.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.080
Angelique...

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:36.200
I'll make good use of your data!

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:48.410
They're here?

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.440
I can feel it.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.810
We will have to fight my brothers.

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:56.660
So they were waiting for us, were they?

00:10:56.800 --> 00:11:00.270
No matter what happens, our resolve shall not waver.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:04.600
We're heading straight for the room where Lady Angelique is being held.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:11.080
Let's finish this, Lein.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:15.380
Lein...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.330
We've been expecting you, Orb Hunters.

00:11:45.740 --> 00:11:52.130
I've brought my strongest Jinx Squad along to welcome you!

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:54.350
So, he was waiting for us, after all?

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:57.570
We're taking back our princess.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:00.670
Go, Jinx!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:17.750
I'll protect you...

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:19.550
Jade...

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.760
No matter where you are...

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:29.870
Lein...

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.570
Even if it costs me my life...

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:40.730
Nyx...

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:47.880
I'll protect you!

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.130
Hyuuga...

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.010
Jet...

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.340
You're defective.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.330
Stop.

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.600
Jet, I'll stop you!

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:53.210
Don't hurt...

00:13:57.740 --> 00:13:59.910
It's over now.

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.800
the people I care about!

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:16.400
What is this?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:26.970
This light is... Angelique!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.680
I can feel her warm strength.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:32.250
A light filled with love.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.480
You truly are...

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.320
I'm sorry.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.290
Give up, Elenfriet!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.560
I won't let you hurt Angelique anymore!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.640
It's not over yet.

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:42.610
Jet, stand!

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.870
Jet!

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:45.630
What's wrong, Jet?

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:49.180
That's far enough.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.200
Yorgo?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:55.800
Director Yorgo...

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:57.450
This is...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.940
That's enough.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:05.490
I've received reports of your actions.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:09.770
You have ignored the order to shut down the Jinx.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.760
You have ordered a sortie without my permission.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.300
You have concealed the damage caused by this operation.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.590
And now this...

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.210
What were you trying to do that you wanted to hide from me?

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:25.410
I... I... for the Foundation...

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.140
You fool.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.180
Everyone!

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.740
I'm so glad to see you again.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:04.860
The pain of a temporary parting is merely a prelude to the happiness of the reunion.

00:17:04.970 --> 00:17:09.000
It seems, however, that tonight's prelude was a little long than planned.

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:11.050
Your voice reached out to us.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:14.690
A voice that gave us more courage than the greatest of powers.

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:20.250
I will never let you walk the path of suffering again, even if it costs me my life.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:24.180
I heard all your voices too.

00:17:24.300 --> 00:17:29.220
But no matter how close they sounded, I couldn't run to you...

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:32.420
That's why we're here.

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.110
Thank you!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.340
You came too, Erwin?

00:17:43.760 --> 00:17:44.840
Yorgo?

00:17:45.100 --> 00:17:46.190
What do you want?

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:50.080
The Foundation takes full responsibility for this incident.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.730
In the coming days, we will apologize again.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.220
Yorgo.

00:17:55.280 --> 00:17:57.170
Let's go, Angelique.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:01.280
Lein, I need to talk to you.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:05.340
Does it have to be this very minute?

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.470
I see...

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:13.050
The situation is more serious than I thought.

00:18:13.270 --> 00:18:14.640
According to our investigations,

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:20.470
even the Knights of the Silver Tree will soon be unable to hold back the vastly increased power of the Thanatos.

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:23.960
So what do you intend by telling me this?

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.300
I'm sure you've realized...

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:31.510
the possibilities hidden within the light of the Queen's Egg.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:38.380
It's theoretically possible to transmit her Light of Purification over the Jinx's control frequency.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.290
No.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:44.170
It'll put too much strain on her body.

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:47.030
It's the only way out of this situation!

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:48.700
You understand that, don't you?

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.140
Even if I do,

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:51.540
I can't do it.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:55.360
Lein!

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:01.810
Just give me one night.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.680
Lein!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.550
Hey.

00:19:15.760 --> 00:19:17.290
What did Yorgo say?

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.450
Nothing important.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:20.550
Wait!

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:23.100
I want to tell you something.

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:34.460
Elenfriet said that it was possible to use my light to save the world.

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:37.600
It's impossible.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:41.190
Elenfriet's way is too dangerous.

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:44.650
But I've considered what he said...

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:49.660
"If it were possible, would Lein help me?"

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:56.790
If... if it were possible, what would you do?

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:04.870
I'd be really scared. It'd take a lot of courage, but if I could really save people that way...

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.110
Lein...

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:13.330
I don't want to save people that way.

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:17.720
I can't put you in that much danger.

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:23.840
But, as a scientist... I can't deny Yorgo's hypothesis.

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:31.360
According to him, the Knights of the Silver Tree will soon no longer be able to contain the Thanatos.

00:20:33.070 --> 00:20:38.690
If nothing is done, there may come a day when there's no life left on this planet.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.680
So, he suggested a plan.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.100
What is this plan?

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.760
We'd use your power...

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:53.970
If it went well, it would destroy every last Thanatos.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:59.880
But if the operation drags on, it'd put considerable strain on your body.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:03.610
It might kill me.

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:05.490
That's what you're saying?

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:09.460
As long as I'm here, I won't let you die.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.440
We must all go back to the Sunlit Mansion.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:17.360
But you can stop any time you feel like it.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:23.010
It may be unfair to say this, but I want you to make the decision, Angie.

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:30.990
I...

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:36.120
I want to be with everyone in the Sunlit Mansion.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:42.140
But if we don't do anything, even the Sunlit Mansion will someday...

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:49.430
If my power can stop that,

00:21:50.050 --> 00:21:51.170
then I...

00:23:36.050 --> 00:23:37.610
So honest and pure...

00:23:37.760 --> 00:23:39.700
So warm, like the sun...

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:41.870
The noble Prophesied Queen.

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:44.110
Our light, Angelique.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.140
Next time:

00:23:45.180 --> 00:23:46.780
Return, and Then...

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.980
I want to protect the people I care about!
